  "details": "I am aware this doesn't affect many people, but it is SERIOUSLY affecting me.\n\nVRChat Version:  Current live version as of 2/20/2023. Likely 2023.1.1\n\nDescription of the bug: When switching between accounts, all saved avatars don't show up. In addition, sometimes (possibly all the time), there are also no worlds in the worlds menu, aside from the Variety Box and worlds saved as lists.\n\nAdditional weird behavior is that, when switching between accounts, the \"recently used\" list for avatars for one account sometimes replaces the \"recently used\" list of the other account.\n\nRestarting VRChat fixes the problem.\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\n\n1: Log into Account A\n\n2: Log out of Account A\n\n3: Log into Account B\n\n4: Check avatar menu\n\n(and IF the bug doesn't occur)\n\n5: Log out of Account B\n\n6: Log into Account A\n\nAccount A is logged into via VRChat, and Account B is logged into via Steam, just in case this is relevant.",
